data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### viem@2::src.actions.public.simulateContract.test::ContractFunctionExecutionError~2\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/src/actions/public/simulateContract.test.ts#L565-L592\n\n```\nContractFunctionExecutionError: The contract function \"mint\" returned no data (\"0x\").\n\n    This could be due to any of the following:\n```\n\n### 2b9eb002-04ab-53ef-85f1-b9b1f2f846dc\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/glossary/errors.md#L123-L123\n\n```\nErrors [Glossary of Errors in viem.] › RPC › `JsonRpcVersionUnsupportedError`\n```\n\n### viem@2::src.actions.public.simulateContract.test::ContractFunctionExecutionError~4\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/src/actions/public/simulateContract.test.ts#L624-L640\n\n```\nContractFunctionExecutionError: The amount of gas (100) provided for the transaction exceeds the limit allowed for the block.\n\n      Raw Call Arguments:\n```\n\n### f807cdd5-54d4-56fd-a6ac-c750d2ac3d90\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/src/CHANGELOG.md#L4784-L4791\n\n```\nviem › 2.0.0 › Major Changes\n- [#1610](https://github.com/wevm/viem/pull/1610) [`440b3ba7`](https://github.com/wevm/viem/commit/440b3ba7d7faa9e51fe87df07acd6a5d373b3b9a) Thanks [@tmm](https://github.com/tmm)! - Viem 2.0 featuring:\n  - [Low-level OP Stack extensions](https://viem.sh/op-stack),\n  -…\n```\n\n### 3dc8e355-9840-50dc-af0e-991f