onExecutionError: The contract function \"simpleCustomWrite\" reverted.\n\n      Error: SimpleError(string message)\n```\n\n### viem@2::src.actions.public.estimateContractGas.test::ContractFunctionExecutionError\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/src/actions/public/estimateContractGas.test.ts#L381-L418\n\n```\n[ContractFunctionExecutionError: The contract function \"simpleCustomWrite\" reverted.\n\n      Error: SimpleError(string message)\n```\n\n### viem@2::src.actions.wallet.writeContract.test::ContractFunctionExecutionError\n`viem@2` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f · as_of 2026-08-02T23:42:13Z\nhttps://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/src/actions/wallet/writeContract.test.ts#L625-L662\n\n```\n[ContractFunctionExecutionError: The contract function \"simpleCustomWrite\" reverted.\n\n      Error: SimpleError(string message)\n```"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"lookup","recipe":null,"hits":[{"selector":"viem@2::src.actions.public.simulateContract.test::ContractFunctionExecutionError~2","source_url":"https://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/src/actions/public/simulateContract.test.ts#L565-L592","snippet":"ContractFunctionExecutionError: The contract function \"mint\" returned no data (\"0x\").\n\n    This could be due to any of the following:","project":"viem","version":"2","version_defaulted":true,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-08-02T23:42:13Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f"},{"selector":"2b9eb002-04ab-53ef-85f1-b9b1f2f846dc","source_url":"https://github.com/wevm/viem/blob/88d68aa3896c88930c84387ca4145653a7c9615f/site/pages/docs/glossary/errors.md#L123-L123","snippet":"Errors [Glossary of Errors in viem.] › RPC › `JsonRpcVersionUnsupportedError`